  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSB core activities in statistical support 2022-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Statistics Norway for smaller technical projects, participation in international statistical working groups, and participation in international networks and conferences about support to statistical capacity building of national statistical agencies in developing countries. Main products and work flows: 1: Data for now (Data4Now); 2: Administrative data and registers; 3: Civil Registration/ Vital Statistics (CRVS); 4: International statistical cooperation and development projects; 5: Systematic work with learning systems</narrative>
  </description>
